    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Canvas Overview",
      "id": "canvas-overview",
      "intro": "Canvas adalah area kerja utama Scenario Studio. Di sini Anda akan membuat alur deteksi fraud dengan cara drag-and-drop node kondisi. Halaman ini menjelaskan bagian-bagian canvas dan cara navigasinya.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Sidebar Kiri — Daftar Kondisi",
          "desc": "Panel di sebelah kiri canvas berisi 6 tipe kondisi yang bisa Anda gunakan: {previewHtml:1}\n\n• **LOGICAL** — AND/OR/NOT/XOR untuk menggabungkan kondisi\n• **CONTAINS** — Mencari teks dalam data\n• **CONSTANT** — Membandingkan dengan nilai tetap\n• **DEVIATION** — Mendeteksi penyimpangan\n• **AGGREGATE** — Hitung jumlah, total, atau rata-rata\n• **GEO** — Deteksi berdasarkan lokasi\n\nCukup **drag** node dari sini ke kanvas untuk mulai menggunakannya.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;overflow:hidden;display:flex;gap:0;\"><div style=\"width:70px;background:#f8fafc;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Kondisi</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);color:#6366f1;font-weight:600;\">LOGICAL</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);color:#059669;font-weight:600;\">CONTAINS</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);color:#d97706;font-weight:600;\">CONSTANT</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.08);color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;\">DEVIATION</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600;\">AGGREGATE</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.08);color:#2563eb;font-weight:600;\">GEO</div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed #6366f1;font-size:7px;color:#6366f1;\">⬇️ Drag ke sini</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Area Kanvas Utama",
          "desc": "Bagian tengah adalah kanvas ReactFlow tempat semua node berada. Cara navigasi: {previewHtml:1}\n\n• **Pan (geser layar)** — Tekan **Space** + **Drag** mouse\n• **Zoom** — Scroll mouse atau trackpad\n• **Pilih node** — Klik node untuk memilihnya\n• **Pilih banyak** — **Shift + Klik** beberapa node\n• **Pindah node** — **Drag** node ke posisi baru\n• **Klik kanan** — Context menu (edit, delete, color, dll)\n\nCanvas akan menunjukkan grid dan background untuk memudahkan penempatan node.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#f1f5f9);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;min-height:80px;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#93c5fd 0.4px,transparent 0.4px);background-size:16px 16px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;padding:10px;display:flex;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.15);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">IF</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">AND</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);border:1.5px solid #10b981;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">ALERT</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Toolbar Bawah",
          "desc": "Toolbar floating di bagian bawah canvas memberi akses cepat ke fitur-fitur penting: {previewHtml:1}\n\n• **Info Rule** — Melihat ringkasan rule yang sedang diedit\n• **+ Condition** — Shortcut untuk menambah node kondisi baru\n• **Auto-Arrange** — Merapikan posisi node otomatis dengan satu klik\n• **Back / Continue** — Pindah antar langkah workflow\n\nToolbar ini selalu terlihat di bagian bawah layar, tidak peduli seberapa jauh Anda zoom atau pan.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:5px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569;font-weight:500;\">Info Rule</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#6366f1;color:#fff;font-weight:600;\">+ Condition</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;\">Auto</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;\">Back</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;\">Next</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
